# --- vendored Shaka ---
# The compiled player IS committed (see LICENSE-THIRD-PARTY) so the repo builds
# without a 20-minute Closure build. A blanket `dist/` rule above would hide it,
# and git cannot re-include a file underneath an ignored directory, so the
# directory has to be un-ignored first.
!src/w3cmedia/shakaplayer/dist/
src/w3cmedia/shakaplayer/dist/*
!src/w3cmedia/shakaplayer/dist/shaka-player.compiled.js
!src/w3cmedia/shakaplayer/dist/shaka-player.compiled.d.ts
